### Get teacher task bank (TEACHER)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teacher/task-bank/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### Create choose task in teacher task bank
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teacher/task-bank/tasks/choose
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "task": "Choose the correct word",
  "possibleAnswers": "cat|dog|bird",
  "correctAnswers": [1],
  "hint": "Think about the sound",
  "section": "Animals",
  "points": 2
}

### Create write task in teacher task bank
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teacher/task-bank/tasks/write
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "task": "Write the past tense of go",
  "correctAnswers": ["went"],
  "section": "Grammar",
  "points": 1
}

### Assign task bank task to lesson
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teacher/task-bank/tasks/write/{{task_public_id}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lessonPublicIds": ["{{lesson_public_id}}", "{{second_lesson_public_id}}"]
}
